    "label": "thm:fullinfo",
    "number": "Theorem 1",
    "quote": "Define $L_T^* = \\max\\ev{\\min_\\pi \\EE{\\sum_{t=1}^T \\pi(\\Sw_t)\\transpose \\bloss_t}, 4(\\log d + 1)}$. Setting $\\eta = \\sqrt{(\\log d + 1)/L_T^*}$, the regret of FPL in the full information scheme satisfies $R_T \\le 2 m\\sqrt{2 L_T^* (\\log d + 1)}$."
   },
   "confidence": "medium",
